{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（12日）中午12時21分，警方接報，一名女子在淺水灣泳灘暈倒。救援人員到場，86歲女事主陷入昏迷，由救護車送往律敦治醫院搶救。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130864393056161792970645.jpeg/NiVEGQLAGFmGCFiW3x7tqCEpVBt5sQkShU64zIVOuMw\" alt=\"事主被送到律敦治醫院搶救。（黃偉民攝）\"><figcaption>事主被送到律敦治醫院搶救。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T06:03:49.167801+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}